1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,940
Every event. Every seat. In sync.

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,616
This is SeatCraft.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,815
Browse what's on, filter by day or category,

4
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,340
and open the event you want.

5
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:17,002
Every venue has its own seat map.

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:21,740
One tap finds the best seats together. C5, and C6.

7
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:26,088
With the view from your seat, and a live total of Rs 1,600.

8
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,880
Add the guest's name, and confirm.

9
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:35,243
The ticket is ready, saved as a PDF and an image, in one click.

10
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:40,521
Plans change? Find any booking in seconds.

11
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:43,101
Cancel it, and the seats are free again.

12
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:49,540
For organizers, SeatCraft spots schedule clashes before tickets go on sale,

13
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:53,273
suggests a fix, and publishes once the schedule is clear.

14
00:00:57,350 --> 00:01:00,926
Three venues. One box office. Fully offline.

15
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:03,015
Great events start with a seat.

